cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this board design in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camera-gpio-interface-pcb: camera GPIO interface board"
abstract: >-
  KiCad design, fabrication outputs and documentation for a passive interface
  board between three FLIR Blackfly S cameras, a pyControl breakout and a
  Neuropixels OneBox in the Janelia Dudman lab joystick rig: screw-terminal
  camera connectors, two BNC inputs, four 3.3 V BNC outputs, a 50-pin digital
  instrument port and USB power.
authors:
